values ('ap_chemistry', 2, '2.2', array['2.2', '2.7']::text[], 'convention', 'Bond order, bond length, and bond energy', 'Covalent bond length depends on the size of the atoms'' cores and on bond order, and bonds of higher order (single, double, triple) are shorter and have larger bond energies.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-chemistry-reference-u2-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u2-r1-008; ced=2.2.A.2 "Bonds with a higher order are shorter and have larger bond energies"')
