values ('ap_chemistry', 2, '2.4', array['2.4']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Interstitial alloy', 'An interstitial alloy forms between atoms of significantly different radii, with the smaller atoms filling the interstitial spaces between the larger atoms (e.g., carbon in the interstices of iron in steel).', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-chemistry-reference-u2-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u2-r1-012; ced=2.4.A.2 "smaller atoms fill the interstitial spaces between the larger atoms"')
