values ('ap_chemistry', 2, '2.6', array['2.6']::text[], 'convention', 'Choosing among nonequivalent Lewis diagrams', 'When several valid Lewis diagrams are possible and they are not equivalent, use the octet rule and formal charge as the criteria to decide which one is the best model for predicting molecular structure and properties.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-chemistry-reference-u2-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_chemistry-u2-r2-004; ced=2.6.A.2: "The octet rule and formal charge can be used as criteria for determining which of several possible valid Lewis diagrams provides the best model"')
